            "text": "<p>Automatically enjoy perks from our <a href=\"https://hiatuscrafthouse.com/products/hiatus-membership\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Lollygaggers Bottle Club\">Lollygaggers Bottle Club</a> including:</p><ul><li>Up to 25% off all bottles, merchandise, and Hiatus Craft House events.</li><li>One weekly complimentary tasting for you and one guest.</li><li>Exclusive access to member-only events</li><li>Premiere access to new products.</li><li>Loyalty points on all purchases to redeem for future discounts.</li></ul>",
